$t$3. Where a deck, pergola, verandah or balcony is more than 1m above ground level and is setback 2m or less from a common boundary, building work includes a privacy screen at the perimeter of the deck, pergola, verandah or balcony extending not less than 1.5m above the floor level.$t$, 'VERIFIED_VERBATIM', 'Page 52', 52, 'Chapter 2');
